{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1304,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eafbbc35c77d8d75819a4d5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为随时都会有中暑的风险，\r\n所以一定要做好补充水分的行程表，\r\n也要记得携带自己的水壶。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c91f755caa54ca477fc7c97482f9a55743fb38218991b95a3592c20c0f36c465",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b2d842856de61e8669babe5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到德国的秋天……\r\n果然还是会想到慕尼黑啤酒节。\r\n希望有机会可以招待你参加呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b34e9bc074f3e87a27dd0f0e0e19ea0bfcfa2ed9cfdf48b6b8b60f92bd92e1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6b14760cdaa3e81a66f3e62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬天就是会不小心长时间待在室内。\r\n……趁这时候来开发新蛋糕好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "27eeda98939ba2936ebcfd8eaeb3d95ec6b565a67920933d604269cb12a28d6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f256835cd6fdf779187397c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安。\r\n请一起念出开启一天的咒语吧。\r\n……Ich gebe mein Bestes!",
      "source_fingerprint": "19be8a308cbc51681dea259f56816938a9ca4fad13ce1156c4b0528f3c668e29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2454f5d69bb7ff677e0e33eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每次和大家打招呼时，\r\n都会被说有股很香的味道……\r\n原因是我早上烤的饼干吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ac8e4792f1591d2ee013fca8ae98f476a6f0de4de48259f118ad3df109f535e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9eb4c9a89ef82abd5657f36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "摄取糖分能增添下午的活力。\r\n只不过，\r\n必须要有计划地摄取才行……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d114636e83dbb9ecc0e3f9d5101b92d606396cf4115d819eba1247e9d561b97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f1c7061dbd78ac010f5c8ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "再怎么忙也一定要休息。\r\n父亲说过，\r\n这是能将工作做好的秘诀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a454a681cc2f9df396af9a735764dbd553e08617882cf513c5d174f6c1dc06b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb21227eee82a825eb267b0d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个时间禁止吃点心。\r\n就算再怎么想吃，\r\n也要忍到明天……才可以喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e5984199b3696d603a21ef5fc08dbb385641d98b80e4deb65d4e411fd684c78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e73a0bbe44af5ec2f0c651a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "做好面糊的准备了。接下来\r\n就是放在冰箱静置12小时……\r\n呵呵，还请好好期待吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bac1b2ae2f16f0db89375e09536c88a511c79d12822ea84837b44cda12bf64c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55adac3c2fbce54bcc6264cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看见樱花就会让我想起\r\n和父母一起赏花的回忆……呵呵，\r\n其实德国也有一整排的樱花树喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dee9de3f69f77c2ebba4e3c5792c710f16604c3c12943b65dd63f9d1600221a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2da4f921a9aee7027e89feee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年也开始变热了呢……\r\n不过还请放心，\r\n我有做了冰蛋糕Kalter Hund。",
      "source_fingerprint": "379b5ac4c4abebc8f7b6a59b12a126791e33de50ee2cf2b69a64e201d2dcbc9a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0447840a9f60233db0644404",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我最近在尽可能地做些\r\n低热量的点心。毕竟是食欲之秋，\r\n得确实做好管理才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85077e27aca9d955f291777edc3e4b4eb3c5859b82e5ca0038ac9796cbc91187",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4663ca80955184a31e1f0978",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "点心基本上都是冷却后食用，\r\n不过吃了就会感受到温暖……\r\n真的是很不可思议呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "241200c5430fabda8905c495adfff4a50acb1de238921a3bca90db4f4010b4b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5aaa6c0cad9454b465e07f0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bba35c113ed8fbb5e0c7475a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1a376e018187acd3dc5aad8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "日光は適切に浴びられていますか？\r\n充実した1日は、体内時計の\r\nリセットから始まるものですよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "244ee5bdff6436f746a41470041ebb43231229de0c53f8ff3e01dd04221946ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6353a52125d2e15648a12631",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "毎朝、ランニングで決まった時間に\r\nお会いして…ドゥラメンテさんも\r\n時間に正確な方なのでしょうか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "42347b4439a5401b7cc3c80f9dfa25106c98bf7aab1aadadcf165a59d5109c1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4801cc038c5132cb4853e7c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "世界には水中サッカーなる\r\n競技があるそうですが…。\r\n特訓に活かせないでしょうか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c57a54889f96c76edf734d08ba90ced995d44ba0e17f57e092d3ff1e62a82699",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90212"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8db3ec21fe5167e611371c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冷蔵庫で冷やしているんです、\r\n手作りのスパゲッティアイス。\r\nどんな味かはお楽しみ…ですよ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "eefb5ab4a312e651ff97be5bc8d240f1a6e606be791e7fb9716e4fbb4a4605b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90213"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:014aea8dc61a339543ba8fef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ドイツには、天国に行けない鬼火の\r\nお話があります。…幼い頃は怖いと\r\nいうより、悲しく感じました。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4a1ae940f5716fd3313954f54e0fa0252d75a26753568ee6d0d9550666a03ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90214"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72da908c0e3a943e80fccaf2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜はRuhezeit…安静時間です。\r\n皆さんがゆっくり休めるよう、\r\n静かに過ごしましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a506da20870c3d7c955bab23d791a6374eee26dc3e8d0acc3975cefadc36c3df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7ee1e7d8af7cc02cbf30641",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Spargel…白アスパラガスが\r\n美味しい季節ですね。あの甘みを\r\n味わうと、春の訪れを感じます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f436e8d87fdaa899e2f05745137a77d119f7b521fabeaadce91e938e4ba35b5e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2daad38c97178fe63d53e6f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "クーラーの涼しさには少し慣れない\r\nですね。ドイツでは扇風機が\r\n一般的、でし、て…くちゅんっ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "232c93398e30e9a8483db1fc188c18400d7aa365bd1c8689bb728c51fae550b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a66c10c7b850400e9e4cc71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ご一緒に映画鑑賞はいかがですか？\r\nこの季節、情緒的な余韻が残る\r\nしっとりとした作品がおすすめです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "700a341c33ca0503cc374c7d851ea7084ca77e5db242c1e8ed6c1427e11d2f95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f58db77a8b91eefd10bb2f7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "日本にも水着で入れる入浴施設が\r\nあるんですよね？健康促進のため、\r\n通えればと思いまして。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4a35b47e630eb94da64ab13b3606cb72ddec6891e3bacddaeaad48ef3631820",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c3dcd1b1bb85e2cd629ea6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハッピーバレンタイン",
      "source_fingerprint": "205aa64f55aa5b5868c584cadc0b5dcd8e05b84b0a76c8efb1da86986277c562",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f84676b31871974ee53ea6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我跟着节拍器在哼歌的时候，\r\n飞鹰突然从背后出现……\r\n害我不小心吓得叫了出来……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdc5206135474a1270baefe1bd57db96173ca9e416e8d6f35e9afb582d8018c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f252df3eb6977ca2fbf5557a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可以轻松维持和那么多人的友谊……\r\n佐敦或许很擅长安排时间呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b9f4078590431505b6d5b2377811c41668d2700eec434e29aa8dd4969bf6b08",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1ea86913dd88dd7f01f5981",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然中山对胜负的态度和我相反。\r\n但也因为如此，\r\n才让我觉得有值得学习的空间。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee0df6196f030d1669a8375db1b90a580b236f056fa6f1483df588a5f830e5ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0092e75902e1f44b2d4bf9a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我和黄金船约好要一起逛蛋糕店……\r\n但不知不觉间，\r\n就变成古早味零食一把抓之旅了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b5a32a85d0c3e819b4a2f397865e935467e6cedf54b47caa5e72c31587112ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57310e29283b26232c82817d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喜欢看电影，但唯独僵尸片……\r\n已经腐烂的尸体怎么可能那样动呢？\r\n太奇怪了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb4e7ae9ec219d6a83aee022905ec1c13d692d040c82bfec1aa5a6a5c87d0ecb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc5645bbae8a5fd621f3b3ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每一个过程都要完美……\r\n这样才不辜负观众对我的期望，\r\n也不会对一起奔跑的对手失礼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f14011e8145d00fa9a9611e49581405de8d6d9708ae5830a1492fa644070fd18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63056a3aa890393290023544",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我原本就是喜欢嘉年华的人。\r\n想到能穿这套衣服跳舞，\r\n我就满心期待呢，呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "31184a1db6c3c875b51b46f5460359f1912c751f21a6ad0bb4c745c22641ad59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8aafcc1886c9bdeb2388c6bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "柔软蓬松却又耐得住激烈动作……\r\n真的是很棒的一套服装。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd57c8bbd4f8101ce1d237eb28b41e843af83e6dab8ce645cc05a01e0c9f6303",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f82766397ec5b29085231d03",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "量身打造的完美比例……\r\n为我制作这套服装的师傅，\r\n技术实在令人佩服。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2095601685fafec6c26803cf0f7886d8e1aea1fb1d16a800b9dd0908cfb4226b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca2eb6e4c26f64d3baf48296",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开店前弥漫着甜点刚出炉的香气……\r\n有时候我也会觉得很想家呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c21ef0316bd116a0f9a15cb8d64cb32994de3fd9f9aa812cd7dbfc2506df4c56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95f1687ebc03460166c348ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在德国，午餐是一天三餐的重点。\r\n我现在也没有改变这个习惯。\r\n在运动方面来说这也是合理的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e13cc2c5942cd0ef4a106232406ab6f484630df1f86ca36f2914fdd34150bb07",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:483c2bc3aa7c90e2afe65dda",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果有能以秒为单位进行设定的\r\n闹钟就好了……但说到底，\r\n最可靠的或许还是生理时钟吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73bf92c5a185897f763eddf8ee3a047d585a2158d10ee1f855ccf3a90b493aca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7facff165bd26730b65284fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又来到了能看见瓢虫的季节了。\r\n……瓢虫真的是很可爱呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7448872624e64f929fbad56842d6266635a29a6e42b749e3181aafb8007f18e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe6306e276e5710b518ae43d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真的是很热呢……\r\n虽然其实更想去湖泊，\r\n但我就在游泳池凉快一下好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a50ca3277c2b58a9e3ca6ca270e54b8bb49d60e6bc18c04062c8e3de3c6776ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:822ce41d369d692ef17e4cc5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "运动之秋吗？\r\n那我……想要踢足球呢。\r\n可以的话，希望你能陪我一起。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2173eeac6efbe4cce2939c8dba6e44ace65b6a6a768efed3578159240a4ba64a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:328bb8d7639723ff26a636b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下雪时就会想起德式圣诞蛋糕……\r\n每到了圣诞节，\r\n我都会帮忙一起做喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e03bf986f1bc62fe19f285b88d487dae96195ba9c2ae4c2b20e75f4a74e24fd3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f68d6526d17d76fdabb17789",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "飞鹰闻我衣服的气味，\r\n就说中了我做的点心。\r\n实在让人有点害羞……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c78c65476021a5fbe41c7076697acfe793e7f1a476554e5aca9452a87cb1f81b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3f6d51f48ea4eb0ea595d44",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要制作新作品，\r\n进王就一定会来试吃。\r\n是帮了大忙……但她怎么知道的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "94436cfcf97bdc1f171424296c6fd27226074ff38eef94f00264c6e85f27a6a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acbe28a880a56b05adeb39ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近会和小花交换手工饼干。\r\n吃起来非常顺口……\r\n很有疗愈感呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "67083b87dcba6530a247698b202893c6fc8f1233f0d0f3e721c2883906c7e001",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02b6c6ced9b909580a55eb02",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "至今所做的一切都会被加以审视，\r\n这点我相信无论是竞赛还是\r\n甜点师的工作……都是一样的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bccf87b09c057f905b38791824fb4ab22c4f4816b4b062bbc071f973c48fbe5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1844f7df6fde718f64adac79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为生日或其他特别的日子做点缀\r\n也是甜点师的工作。\r\n所以……我会用奔驰点缀竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "902efed4ee92c5d360226eb8ab65f463f103332e498756d0526c92d6b4f5ac73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12312eac16b42f1dc4920b7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上是完成\r\n当天所有准备的时间……\r\n这是甜点师的铁则。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4307adb47713e0ce18028aa3c3531b6a764b37faf7c4c2439b59aad9cc35bca5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9be58efb3c0465fb176a34c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "餐后甜点和正餐之间的零食……\r\n虽然都是点心，\r\n但要配合时间点做调整才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48cf54aac925011f2741ed13cf7262ab7d4a99dcf6094bdb1993a6f0d81dfd78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2490ae0627eede9d260bd68",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Konditor……甜点师的一天\r\n可说是从夜晚开始的。\r\n毕竟要进行明天的准备。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e8f2a9569d6d82ce421d8d86e9f55def95b437d528b996e0585cf213e7d065a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aee1e14b170169313ad6c30b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赏花的季节……\r\n不用白雪改用樱花的意境\r\n制作德式圣诞面包或许也不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "44b345ef871fd46710c08b93dfa5c108d48e7e621131c39a4cdd637986a27f4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a25a7537535e409dd2221b4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要去德国旅行建议夏天前往。\r\n有机会的话让我带你去观光。\r\n行程安排还请交给我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "55ebdb2962f198958ef851cc5215b5e0c59724660264c08939950137e26621ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f560e8459b4e2911a7d79d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想出去捡栗子呢……\r\n我想到了一个\r\n应该会很好吃的蒙布朗食谱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c8eefd1e36ee0f93d4d9e9354cf3f6ea562d3aca09771a6b6e32ea44d6446e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1768882810d97cc2863153ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节和圣诞节……\r\n以点心为主的日子越接近，\r\n就越令人振奋呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "266f5e68940c8184723fd379932942ebda72aaa32d3f9a27835577fc82f83ca6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf4fbb1a69392f24350a8c9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "职人，原本是经历严苛的修行\r\n才能获得的称号。我希望自己能\r\n别忘记这套服装具有的意义。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb555bfda5a5ef2a9e6f1b9369619ace7a13f5d8878775f07210965d46db927c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4226a3bfc0f4a51e9bd031b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上这套服装，\r\n就会涌现面对作品的热情……\r\n有点像是竞赛开始前的心情呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2752c294a47aa4ca04d44e6914a2fff1f96773474c8bc3186732692cb2a71ad0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0696961ba76989134fea6642",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近、ウマドルについて両親に\r\n聞かれるんです。ファルコンさんの\r\nおかげで興味を持ったようで。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dcd13346341b522896d1e4fadd7cdd5b8e04ecbde27000e35aa528b8c6a876e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:760456b8b17bc070259fd508",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "リッキーさんが教えてくれた運気と\r\n時間帯の関係、興味深いですね。\r\nスケジュール管理に活かせそうです",
      "source_fingerprint": "11368d8eb4bc23c1b6b91c8013022a5241469f84ba89db63495a50828c6879b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0369c32254f26d0bee2344d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "タルマエさんのウマッター、本当に\r\n苫小牧への愛に溢れているんです。\r\n地元を思う気持ち、共感できます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ab3b6d612a4b22112f52f7b8ef5da9c495166c465266b63812cbe912ccf656b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfeac1a57a76eadf82f635e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今度、漬物の交換会をやるんです。\r\nアキュートさんのぬか漬けと、\r\n私のザワークラウトを。",
      "source_fingerprint": "93021cf4c7fff8da673f62f0d832d6211eeef1bdfba1cec7ade225757ffb5f78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7d12eeeca12dbfeabe67b8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "納豆とバニラアイスを混ぜると\r\n美味しいらしいのですが…\r\n好物とはいえ、勇気がいりますね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c21ed09b03b7525fd239f38c9d51220023029f7dfcd7a614d36a199204f8fc81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1388725f7cd7016b6ee3e2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ラジオ体操は合理的ですね。\r\n3分11秒で13種類もの運動を…\r\n手軽に行える点も高評価です。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f12bb23322d7f38ae3846e116be0a7da7c58306f15e6b1884395a394ff936ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe7ae44daf241f265b334169",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "水の中に潜ると、時間の流れが\r\n止まったみたいで…。少しだけ、\r\n心もとなくなってしまいますね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf4c47b93fa76f4f5bafc0f4efb508cb5968137f84a0c507d3341eb91af2ed05",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39c54e95431dc29e65467cc0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よろしければ語り聞かせを\r\nいたしましょうか？貴方が\r\n眠くなるまで、グリム童話を…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "11b7d0f3252c84cafab4c46ac8a8936f7516301444c611323fc2d0d2be9dd643",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91223"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c455f965e87e6c7c585206d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "花壇でお話ししたのですが…\r\nネオユニヴァースさんも\r\nお好きなんですね、テントウムシ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "947c7170804313241cc90c1d732ca03d3f283e91162db0b73bb8e66945753bad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91224"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4f6063d778eaf99f2643f6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏といえば、両親と過ごした湖畔の\r\nロッジを思い出します。3人一緒に\r\nハンモックでお昼寝したりして…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6f1b50780fdcb5d9d66334fcd94c8a6c421df41d12c9c634f9f99c87d93e1f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91225"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a71f098aec40301abcd43648",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "日本のかぼちゃ祭りも行ってみたい\r\nですね。ドイツだと、くり抜いた\r\nかぼちゃで川下りをするんですよ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e93fbe895f4fe49cdbe1f3197bed0201440de72246caec90a49778c7eb0d8f6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91226"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9332e93d353e104b27180e14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "恐ろしいですね、こたつ…。\r\n予定があるからと急かしても、\r\nファルコンさんったら亀のように…",
      "source_fingerprint": "f73750c0f13b4a249fc1164d5548f64a8be11ebf56788802aa8c522b4e26d43a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91227"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6aca4b4301772d8cf0bd9d38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この耳飾り、ルナフラッシュが\r\n使われているんです。主な効果は\r\n『感情の察知』…らしいですよ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e007f720ecefde1fe2fab5010c9208a810950b7fbc4dc97a33f2d117f88d6365",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91228"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9032d5b259cdefcf05a0d69",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "水着に合わせて、ネイルも施して\r\nみました。夏の青空をイメージ\r\nしたのですが…どうでしょうか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4150c2691618d7937429161eceb225172dc8bdbe310cb4993c2bdc688c0688c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91229"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1caea9b1da27ca2176ad7a5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们一起朝目标迈进吧。\r\n首先要先拟定好计划才行呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0c9290c50253919350a668c7d13deacf2f91956969dd2dfa3f4bef24bc3c1b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8263d524d91f937d1eab2ded",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いきます……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8b7db84f06d3b8c3e77990bfb56fbba00a26176992743740345b9ae0ae5f420",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b2f3365d2a8eb108378c1bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "确认过了行程，好。\r\n来开始度过今天吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b29f580743b43207586e619e9189bc60b8c6ec3807f5349ed1bd0f0ca550178",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b522fba971b871d0d7d3cbcf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论距离目标有多遥远，\r\n只要确实拟定好计划，\r\n我就能朝着目标持续前进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "681f5b0b56478f380ac64e677d38684b993b7466300a907a767d8848a0e0ec48",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f859344af60d3be93dfffde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经做好了事前的准备。\r\n接下来就烦请你指导了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d215effdd41b302e4cdcea7b0ec5db000956cbd75b06085a3abe112db05cd3da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ecf82b60df097294db6f3ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和你一起就能完成目标……\r\n我如此深信着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6774921e85fdeb6bab222e6b8c14a6cda47e764c5f50b941420553ac39147111",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd75ad128d23ccf512ed5d87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们一起来拟定计划吧。\r\n我很相信你的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8341bdd1fc7ada66d1275168e2dbb07f617d39e0f5d37210b594c87ea1c5fda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d80b842cdc6f0610416d4d39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果你发现我有什么做不好的地方，\r\n请不要客气，一定要指正我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c93f3bd048e8abbbfd371e3156269032716f044002e739cfc33153075171251c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d98aabd0658ad69ba60c4d9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还真是新奇……\r\n因为在德国，\r\n比起海水浴更流行湖水浴嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f69bdb28c243d3c01e6853df5907d9140472c1145366a8af54784442665c651f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ddffa3cdc88f80bc6cfbbc0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "做好万全准备了。\r\n那么，öffnen……开店吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "186ad216d935d3c17e74682d184630dce79ffc2ce21f8d7882d138d1b05d1ae6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "92015"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
